    "model": "Activity: badminton doubles. Strategy 1, attacking the weaker player: smashes and drops are directed at the opponent with the weaker defence, so the stronger partner is left to cover a large part of the court. It uses the team's accuracy and exploits an uneven pairing. Strategy 2, length in the rally: high, deep clears to the back of the court force the opponents back, so the front of the court opens for a drop shot. It uses the team's stamina and exploits an opposition that defends the back court poorly.",
